<title>UK: SGZ-Bank sets 200 mln mark REX-linked 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>SGZ-Bank sets 200 mln mark REX-linked 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SGZ-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     *6.00     MATURITY    06.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.85     PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST YEAR THEN PAYS 80 PCT OF THE 10-YEAR</p>
<p>		 REX SUBINDEX.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
